8	 * Step of {@code POST /api/owners}: assigns the new owner's {@code customerCode}. The
9	 * sequence number is one more than the owners already in the new owner's city (see
10	 * {@link SameCity}), so it is computed on the built owner before {@link SaveOwner} persists
