5	/**
6	 * The single definition of an owner's customer code: {@code <CITY3>-<LAST3>-<NNNN>}, where
7	 * CITY3 is the upper-cased first three letters of the city and LAST3 the upper-cased first
8	 * three letters of the last name (fewer when either is shorter), and NNNN is a 4-digit
9	 * zero-padded sequence number.
10	 *
11	 * <p>Formatting only; the sequence value is supplied by the caller
12	 * ({@link AssignOwnerCustomerCode} derives it from the owners already in the city).
13	 */
